# Generated files — Prettier must never reformat build output.
#
# `public/build` holds the Vite bundles that this repository commits. The
# pre-commit hook runs Prettier against every staged .js/.css file, which
# reformatted the minified bundle into an expanded, pretty-printed version.
# The content was still valid, but it no longer matched what `npm run build`
# emits, so every build left the working tree dirty and the committed asset
# stopped being a faithful build artifact. ESLint already ignores
# `public/build/**`; this closes the same gap for Prettier.
public/build

vendor
node_modules
